### ─── SET BUDGET — Shopping ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/budget
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "Shopping",
  "monthlyLimit": 8000,
  "month": 5,
  "year": 2025,
  "alertThreshold": 90
